<http://purl.org/dc/terms/language> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A language of the resource."@en-us .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/language> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Recommended best practice is to use a controlled vocabulary such as RFC 4646 [RFC4646]."@en-us .
