<http://purl.org/dc/terms/relation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A related resource."@en-us .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/relation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Recommended best practice is to identify the related resource by means of a string conforming to a formal identification system."@en-us .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/relation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/relation> .
